<div xmlns:perseus="http://www.perseus.org/meta/perseus.rdfs#" xmlns:dctype="http://purl.org/dc/dcmitype/" xmlns:tufts="http://www.tufts.edu/" xmlns:alph="http://alpheios.net/namespaces/tei" class="alpheios-lex-text_container en">
    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n12860" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἀποκληρ-ωτικός</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ή</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">όν</span>, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>A.</b><i>choosing</i> or <i>acting by lot</i> or <i>chance,
				at random,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">τὸ-κόν</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					S.E.
					<u>P.</u>
					3.79
				</span></i>
			; <i>absurd,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">λόγος</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Phlp.
					<u>in Mete.</u>
					82.35
				</span></i>
			, cf. <i><span class="en">
				Simp.
				<u>in Cael.</u>
				158.3
			</span></i>, <i><span class="en">
				161.21
			</span></i>. </div>
        <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense2"><b>II.</b>
			<i>assigning, allotting,</i>
			
				“<span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">δυνάμεις τοῦ κατ᾽ ἀξίαν ἀ.</span>”
				 <i><span class="en">
					Simp.
					<u>in Epict.</u>
					p.104
				</span></i>
			
			<i><span class="en">
				D.
			</span></i>
		</div>
